16:T754,<ul><li>Step into the spacious embrace of the Deluxe Room, the premier accommodation at Brundhavan Garden Homestay. Spanning 160 square feet, this room is tailor-made for large families or groups, offering three double cot-sized beds that can comfortably sleep up to six guests. The sleeping arrangement allows for both privacy and togetherness, making it ideal for friends, extended families, or those simply looking for extra space to relax and unwind.&nbsp;</li><li>Natural light streams in through well-positioned windows, providing views of the lush hills outside and filling the interior with a warm, inviting glow. The attached private bathroom is modern and well-maintained, ensuring convenience and privacy for all guests. Fluffy towels, clean linens, and careful housekeeping add to the sense of luxury and comfort.&nbsp;</li><li>Designed for both relaxation and functionality, the Deluxe Room includes ample storage for your belongings, practical furniture, and just the right touches to make guests feel at home. A soothing color palette complements the natural beauty seen outside, while subtle décor elements bring a touch of local charm to the room.&nbsp;</li><li>All core amenities are included: high-speed Wi-Fi, 24-hour power supply, CCTV security, and prompt room service. After a long day exploring the hills, guests love gathering for evening stories or planning the next day’s adventure in their roomy private retreat.&nbsp;</li><li>Staying in the Deluxe Room also means easy access to all Brundhavan Garden’s features—check in with a quick phone call or email, and enjoy optional extras like fire camp evenings or customized meal service. At ₹3000 per night, this room promises an enjoyable and memorable stay, offering the ideal combination of comfort, space, and hospitality for larger groups right in the heart of Thandikudi.&nbsp;</li></ul>17:T40a,<p><strong>Special check-in instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>After you complete your booking, you will receive a confirmation email with all your reservation details. Please keep this confirmation handy and present it to the staff member upon your arrival at Brundhavan Garden Homestay. Our friendly team will then guide you through the check-in process and ensure your stay begins smoothly.</li></ul><p>S<strong>pecific Cancellation Instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>If a customer wishes to remove a activity, game etc alone from a final booking after their payment, they will need to inform about this to the staff at our resort and our team will try to refund the particular amount as soon as possible if they have reached our home stay . if they wish to remove it before their arrival , they can contact the support number and inform about the cancellation of the activity,game,&nbsp; etc. the refund will be initiated and the they will mention about the refund time. Cancellation of food should be done before 4 hours.</li></ul>6:[["$","main",null,{"className":"p-4 flex flex-col gap-10 mb-20","children":[["$","$L14",null,{}],["$","$L15",null,{"id":2,"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"<p>&nbsp;Our largest accommodation option, the Deluxe Room spans 160 sq. feet and comfortably houses up to six guests with three double cot-sized beds along with a private attached bathroom. It is ideal for families or groups who want spacious privacy combined with scenic hill views and modern amenities, including 24-hour power supply, CCTV surveillance, and room service. Priced at ₹3000 per night, this room offers an unparalleled stay experience.&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724ASZ0MP1Y95W98ZWN9B.jpg","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724AT4VGRTH6GR2NWSNTP.jpg"],"alt":["deluxe-room-1","deluxe-room-2"],"price":3000,"square_ft":160,"capability":6,"beds":3,"about_stay":"$16","check_in_rules":"<ul><li>Check-In From 9:00 AM - Anytime</li><li>Early Check-In Subject To Availability</li><li>Minimum Check-In Age - 18</li></ul>","check_out_rules":"<ul><li>Check-Out Before Noon</li><li>Express Check-Out</li></ul>","room_rules":"$17","services":[{"service_name":"Free Wifi","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F60KKTBQBPMQ32CST14F38.jpg","icon_alt":"free-wifi-icon"},{"service_name":"CCTV Surveillance","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F618NHQ5XNQYGPB1G1MEWJ.jpg","icon_alt":"cctv-surveillance-icon"},{"service_name":"Childrens Park","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F64ECB9E2E45X3V1ZXN2GV.png","icon_alt":"childrens-park-icon"},{"service_name":"Indoor & Outdoor Games","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6G29D0811E2FSNMYRXF6A.jpg","icon_alt":"indoor-outdoor-games-icon"},{"service_name":"Jeep Safari","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6EZAMVK4MF81WRPE11F20.jpg","icon_alt":"jeep-safari-icon"},{"service_name":"Parking Space","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F63VHDK8TY03HY9WN29ADF.png","icon_alt":"parking-space-icon"},{"service_name":"Room Service","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F64ZJFBD2ZA4VD9Y4S7GRA.png","icon_alt":"room-service-icon"},{"service_name":"Fire Camp","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6JP942CQGYBDSFS16QHRX.jpg","icon_alt":"fire-camp-icon"}]}],["$","$L18",null,{"id":"2"}],["$","$L19",null,{"roomProps":[{"id":2,"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"<p>&nbsp;Our largest accommodation option, the Deluxe Room spans 160 sq. feet and comfortably houses up to six guests with three double cot-sized beds along with a private attached bathroom. It is ideal for families or groups who want spacious privacy combined with scenic hill views and modern amenities, including 24-hour power supply, CCTV surveillance, and room service. Priced at ₹3000 per night, this room offers an unparalleled stay experience.&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724ASZ0MP1Y95W98ZWN9B.jpg","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724AT4VGRTH6GR2NWSNTP.jpg"],"alt":["deluxe-room-1","deluxe-room-2"],"price":3000,"square_ft":160,"capability":6,"beds":3},{"id":3,"name":"Standard Room","description":"<p>Designed for couples or solo travelers, this cozy 110 sq. feet room contains one king-size bed with an attached bathroom, providing a quiet and intimate space for rest. Guests enjoy all basic amenities such as Wi-Fi and clean surroundings with easy access to outdoor activities. Price per night is ₹1500.&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F73HP9W5K2TNS5X8T53G2V.jpg","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F73HPDHJPH573SNWTSDJHQ.webp"],"alt":["standard-room-1","standard-room-2"],"price":1500,"square_ft":110,"capability":2,"beds":1},{"id":5,"name":"Wooden Room","description":"<p>Featuring rustic wooden décor, the 160 sq. feet wooden room offers a unique aesthetic and includes a king-size bed, TV, and an attached bathroom. This room combines natural charm with modern conveniences and room service for a truly relaxing stay, priced at ₹2000 per night&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEGP5WQ6DKB9P49N7C4.webp","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEJ001E7TB7QY0X60Y7.webp"],"alt":["wooden-room-1","wooden-room-2"],"price":2000,"square_ft":160,"capability":2,"beds":1}],"currRoomId":2}]]}],["$","$L1a",null,{}]]
